  "body": "Positioned within one of Manly's most sought-after coastal addresses, 13 East Avenue presents an exceptional opportunity to secure a substantial family residence under mortgagee instructions.\r\n\r\nOccupying approximately 1,037sqm (more or less) of private, this extensively renovated home combines, comfort and lifestyle in a location renowned for its coastal appeal. Offering approximately 250sqm(TBC) of accommodation, the residence has been thoughtfully updated throughout, allowing buyers to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nLight-filled living spaces unfold across a generous floorplan designed to accommodate modern family living. Multiple living areas, open-plan dining and entertaining zones are complemented by expansive windows that capture beautiful sea views and an abundance of natural light.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a stunning new kitchen complete with a walk-in pantry connects seamlessly with both formal and informal living spaces, creating an inviting environment for everyday living and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is equally impressive, featuring five generous bedrooms, two-and-a-half bathrooms, two spacious lounges and the added flexibility of a downstairs kitchenette. Whether accommodating extended family, teenagers, guests, work-from-home requirements or multigenerational living, the layout provides options to suit a wide range of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nOutside, the lifestyle offering continues with extensive entertaining deck, established grounds, a new swimming pool and double garaging. Significant improvements throughout the property include a new kitchen, new bathrooms, updated flooring, refurbished interiors and extensive enhancements that add lasting value.\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Manly Beach, local shops, cafés, restaurants and public transport, this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial coastal holding in a tightly held location.\r\n\r\nMortgagee sales of this calibre are seldom available. Combining a premium address, sea views, generous landholding and extensive renovations, this is a property that demands immediate attention.\r\n\r\nPlease note: Under mortgagee instructions, the property will not be sold prior to the auction on 17 December 2026.",
